OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Fri 27 NovC19:11/32
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/4 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCEBU confirms security breach on   
OL,4,CWorkspace collaboration platform       
OL,6,FThe European Broadcasting Union (EBU)  
OL,7,Fhas told users of its Workspace        
OL,8,Fplatform that an unauthorised third    
OL,9,Fparty gained access to the system      
OL,10,Fearlier this month.                    
OL,12,FEBU Workspace is a members-only online 
OL,13,Fspace used by EBU Members, staff and   
OL,14,Fpartners for project collaboration,    
OL,15,Fdocument sharing, networking and       
OL,16,Fquestion forums.                       
OL,18,FIn an e-mail to users, the EBU's Cyber 
OL,19,FIncident Response Team said the        
OL,20,Fintrusion took place in November 2026, 
OL,21,Fand that it detected and shut off the  
OL,22,Faccess on 19th November.               
OL,23,EPub: 27-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
