CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Fri 27 NovC19:11/32
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/4 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCEBU confirms security breach on   
OL,4,CWorkspace collaboration platform       
OL,6,FAccording to the EBU, details from     
OL,7,Fusers' account profiles may have been  
OL,8,Fviewed, including names, usernames and 
OL,9,Fe-mail addresses. For some users, job  
OL,10,Ftitles and phone numbers may also have 
OL,11,Fbeen accessed. The EBU said Workspace  
OL,12,Fpasswords were not exposed.            
OL,14,FThe organisation noted that accounts   
OL,15,Fare created automatically when someone 
OL,16,Fjoins an EBU group, meaning people may 
OL,17,Fbe affected even if they have never    
OL,18,Flogged in to the platform.             
OL,23,EPub: 27-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14103
SC,0003
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Fri 27 NovC19:11/32
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/4 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCEBU confirms security breach on   
OL,4,CWorkspace collaboration platform       
OL,6,FThe EBU said it has fixed the          
OL,7,Fvulnerability that was exploited,      
OL,8,Fupgraded the platform to a newer       
OL,9,Fversion and replaced the internal      
OL,10,Fsystem credentials it uses. It stressed
OL,11,Fthat this does not affect users' own   
OL,12,Fpasswords.                             
OL,14,FIt identified phishing as the main     
OL,15,Frisk, warning that the exposed         
OL,16,Finformation could be used to send      
OL,17,Fconvincing messages appearing to come  
OL,18,Ffrom the EBU or a colleague.           
OL,23,EPub: 27-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14104
SC,0004
PS,C000
CT,5,T
OL,0,       GCEEFAX 1 141 Fri 27 NovC19:11/32
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/4 
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSCEBU confirms security breach on   
OL,4,CWorkspace collaboration platform       
OL,6,FUsers have been advised to treat       
OL,7,Funexpected messages referring to the   
OL,8,FEBU, Workspace or the incident with    
OL,9,Fcaution, to avoid opening links or     
OL,10,Fattachments in them, and to visit      
OL,11,Febu.ch directly instead.               
OL,13,FThe EBU said it will never ask for a   
OL,14,Fpassword by e-mail, and that suspicious
OL,15,Fmessages should be reported to [email  
OL,16,Fprotected].                            
OL,23,EPub: 27-Nov-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
